WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,100
Waiting for the convoy to set off

2
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:05,470
Just follow this car, I know.

3
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,040
That who

4
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,280
It turns out to be a wandering girl

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:10,400
What's the matter?

6
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:12,940
Miss asked me to ask you

7
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:15,570
Is the team ready? Is it ready?

8
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:18,890
I can leave at any time, please rest assured, madam.

9
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:20,250
if something goes wrong

10
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:27,830
Miss is the big brother who knows how to hold people accountable

11
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:29,960
Can you tell us about this convoy?

12
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,880
Who from the Tie family is leading the team?

13
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:33,570
don't you know

14
00:00:34,190 --> 00:00:36,070
I just came to Yumen Town from outside the border fortress

15
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:37,790
No wonder

16
00:00:38,610 --> 00:00:41,490
Didn't see that luxurious carriage?

17
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:47,590
But sitting there is the third lady of the Tie family

18
00:00:47,790 --> 00:00:49,060
iron three walls

19
00:00:53,150 --> 00:00:55,790
The eldest and second son of the Tie family is famous for being a waste of money.

20
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:58,510
Tie Sanjie, a 12-year-old parent, is gifted with a strange disease

21
00:00:58,870 --> 00:01:01,030
The appearance and the bright moon turned the imperial capital into a beautiful place

22
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:03,460
I didn’t expect that she was leading the convoy.

23
00:01:03,940 --> 00:01:05,860
The only dad I can relate to

24
00:01:06,780 --> 00:01:08,140
Just because of the bright moon
